==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*16 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and a few meatshields to protect it. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] can also counter the Metal Hippoe and Angels as a meatshield. Bring [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] for support and any other [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] or [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]]. [[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Catman]] and his evolved form [[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Catman]] can take out Floating and Angel units respectively. [[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Warlock and Pierre]], and its evolved form, [[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Merchant Babil]], can also help in the same way, but it is advised to use the evolved form. [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] are the biggest threat, due to their high attack rate, speed, and DPS. You could also use [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Kalisa]].

The Face spawns early but is slow, so start by spawning a few meatshields and Rocker Cats to deal with the [[Gabriel]]s while levelling up your wallet and saving up for Bahamut. Once Bahamut is deployed, if you can protect him, this level will be easy. Just spam all of your units and make sure to get Rocker Cat if there is a Metal Hippoe out, and the Paris cats will knock back the Angelic Gories and [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s so Bahamut Cat can hit The Face.

A Rich Cat will make this level much easier, and this is assuming most cats are level 20.

